	<h2>CFPM and CFSETUP</h2>
	<p><strong>Reminder:</strong> Run these in an <em>OS shell</em> on the ColdFusion host, not as CFML tags.</p>
	<h3>CFPM (from CFHOME/cfusion/bin)</h3>
	<pre>cfpm help
cfpm list
cfpm listall
cfpm install document
</pre>
	<h3>CFSetup (from …/coldfusion/config/cfsetup)</h3>
	<pre>cfsetup.bat
help
help add datasource
</pre>
	<p>Adobe: ColdFusion Package Manager · CFSetup configuration tool (links in module lesson).</p>
